<p>A professional clean of a standard single oven usually takes around one and a half to two hours. A double oven typically takes two and a half to three hours, and a large range cooker can take most of a morning. The exact time depends on the size of the oven, how much carbon has built up and whether the hob and extractor are included.</p>
<p>Those times cover cleaning the racks, trays and door glass properly, not just wiping round the inside. Our cleaners work across Hull and East Yorkshire, and we give you an estimated time along with your quote so you can plan your day.</p>
